     <abstract pn="section-abstract">
+      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-1">This RFC reports on the status of most.Network Hosts from October 26
+to November 5.  (Massachusetts celebrated Armistice day on Monday,
+October 25.) During these two weeks the general status of these hosts
+remained as it had been previously.</t>
